{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.volume_perturbation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.volume_perturbation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QIntegerCanonical"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.volume_perturbation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.volume_perturbation","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L70-L76","doc":"**Volume perturbation formula** ([`prop:volume-perturbation-formula`]).\nProved from the upstream class field constraint. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:volume-perturbation-formula","label":"prop:volume-perturbation-formula","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/volume-perturbation-formula.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.perturbation_formula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.perturbation_formula","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L67-L67","doc":"The perturbation identity: `δΦ_k = z² · Vol(4_1) · [k − 3]_q`\nfor all `k ≥ 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.z_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.z_def","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Definitional link: the Markov parameter `z = 1 / (√q + 1/√q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.δΦ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.δΦ","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The actual vertex volume perturbation at level `k`: `δΦ_k`\n(the categorical quantity, to be compared with the closed form). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.Vol_41","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.Vol_41","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The figure-eight hyperbolic volume `Vol(4_1) ≈ 2.030`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.z","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L57-L57","doc":"Markov parameter `z = 1 / (√q + 1/√q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.q","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.VolumePerturbationContext","kind":"class","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L49-L68","doc":"Data of the `volume_perturbation` claim.  All fields are *inputs*\n(the substrate/geometry data and the actual vertex-volume-perturbation\nsequence).  The perturbation identity is carried as an upstream\nclass field (added 2026-08-23 to repair the refutable encoding). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.qIntSym_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.qIntSym_zero","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L44-L47","doc":"**`[0]_q = 0`** — the unperturbed Hecke level (`k = 3`, i.e. `[k−3]_q`\nat `k = 3`) carries no volume perturbation.  Sorry-free. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.qIntSym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.qIntSym","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/volume_perturbation.lean#L39-L42","doc":"The balanced (symmetric) `q`-integer\n`[m]_q = (q^m − q^{−m}) / (q − q^{−1})`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}